  "question": {
    "text": "If the co-efficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math> in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math> are equal, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "55",
  "solution": {
    "text": "We have, the co-efficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>8</mn></msup></math> in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math> are equal.<p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>8</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>55</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
